<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">CAPTURE A WORD</text><view class="title">拍照与语音识词</view><view class="subtitle">识别后先核对文字，再查词或翻译。</view><view class="actions"><button disabled="{{busy || recording}}" bindtap="onPhoto">选择图片</button><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onRecord">{{recording ? '结束录音 '+seconds+'s' : '语音输入'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="card image-card"><image class="capture-image" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="actions"><button disabled="{{busy || recording}}" bindtap="onEditPhoto">编辑 / 裁剪</button><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy || recording}}" bindtap="onRecognize">识别图片</button></view></view><view class="chips"><button class="chip" data-language="en" bindtap="onLanguage">{{language === 'en' ? '✓ ' : ''}}英语识别</button><button class="chip" data-language="zh" bindtap="onLanguage">{{language === 'zh' ? '✓ ' : ''}}中文识别</button></view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="info">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="info">{{error}}</view><textarea class="field capture-text" value="{{text}}" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="10000" placeholder="识别结果会显示在这里，也可直接粘贴文字…"/><view class="actions"><button bindtap="onLookup">查词</button><button bindtap="onTranslate">全文翻译</button><button bindtap="onCopy">复制</button></view><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{tokens}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip" data-word="{{item}}" bindtap="onWord">{{item}}</button></view><view class="footer">拍照与录音仅在点击相应按钮后使用。文件发送到你配置的配套服务完成识别；模型结果可能有误，请核对。当前本地录音转写支持 60 秒以内的中文或英文 WAV。</view></view>
